      <Placemark>
        <name><![CDATA[Pioche & Bullionville]]></name>
        <description><![CDATA[1873-1881; abandoned roadbed used in 1907 by later LA&SL line from Hamlights Station, through Condor Canyon and Meadow Valley Wash to Bullionville. Western portion in Pioche from 1873 Wheeler 100th Meridan report.]]></description>
